From: Ovler <44089074+Ovler-Young@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 22:07:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Configure sidebar expansion around task activity

Collapse idle sidebar sections and expand running task branches by default. Preserve manual choices until activity changes, and expose persistent expansion settings from the Workspaces header and new project group context menus.
